{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otterly Lost is a cozy, story-rich adventure about wonder, friendship, and finding where you belong. You play as Otto, a curious sea otter who got swept away from his mountain home after a strange and sudden natural disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carried downriver and into the open sea, Otto must now find his way back through an island full of wonders, secrets, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/1340c7ccdc4acd0ee35298f0cf7bab66.poster.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/1340c7ccdc4acd0ee35298f0cf7bab66.webm?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/1340c7ccdc4acd0ee35298f0cf7bab66.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f0\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Explore </strong>a vibrant island full of life and hidden corners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a\u00a0<strong>Dive </strong>beneath the waves to uncover underwater mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1a\u00a0<strong>Gather </strong>treasures and special items to boost your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc22\u00a0<strong>Meet</strong> cute animals and help on their quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8\u00a0<strong>Solve</strong> light puzzles and platforming challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>Express </strong>yourself by mixing and matching fun outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/ea9e6eba38587cd3a0153b9c9d7403bc.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much like sea otters in nature, who play an important role in keeping marine ecosystems in harmony, Otto\u2019s journey turns out to be about more than just getting home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious earthquake shakes the island, something feels off. Now it's up to you to set things right and restore the balance of nature! Along your journey, you will meet cute and sometimes mysterious animals, get to know them and their stories, lend a paw in their troubles, and slowly learn how everything is connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/33f997b91c0b407b92a8c2a208214883.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an open-world game, so you can go at your own pace and discover every corner of the island and the surrounding underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/bcd9f97c79bc107717d10c20379f1618.poster.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/bcd9f97c79bc107717d10c20379f1618.webm?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/bcd9f97c79bc107717d10c20379f1618.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through mysterious caves, shipwrecks and kelp forests, glide above rocky canyons and sunny beaches, or simply roam through rich terrains and forests. Every step (or splash) uncovers something new: a story, a view, or a quiet moment to take in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/cea55a17087778642d7587173618ff18.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otters know a thing or two about using tools, especially rocks! As you explore the island, you\u2019ll gather useful gear to help you out: dig up hidden shells, smash through obstacles blocking your way, and zip across tricky gaps. You\u2019ll also upgrade your natural abilities, learning to swim faster, jump higher, climb easier, and glide further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/faaf35ebca1f73fd8a3790fc0f980dc6.poster.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/faaf35ebca1f73fd8a3790fc0f980dc6.webm?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/faaf35ebca1f73fd8a3790fc0f980dc6.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about wandering, discovering, and helping others at your own pace. Along the way, you\u2019ll face light platforming and puzzles that add just the right touch of challenge \u2013\u00a0fun, rewarding, and never too intense. It\u2019s a warm, curious adventure where cozy exploration and playful problem-solving go paw in paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/9ff00f54fb385e7e3bbbd46475aa37d5.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a lively bunch of island characters: funny, sweet, wise, bubbly, and even a little grumpy. Some could use your help, while others may guide you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.poster.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.webm?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get to know them, hear their stories, and build friendships, you\u2019ll take one step closer to restoring the island\u2019s natural balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/be973a908acdcaa1c5a61b46347372fd.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuables by completing quests, solving puzzles, or simply exploring the island\u2019s many hidden corners. Trade them in for cute outfits, quirky hats, and cozy accessories to express your otter self in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From gliding through the air to splashing in the water, a touch of style fits everywhere. Who says otters can\u2019t have their own fashion?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861710?t=1755353596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/9e048be4f51512753128e0488229b44d3cb784cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755353596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s