eam/apps/3861710/extras/faaf35ebca1f73fd8a3790fc0f980dc6.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about wandering, discovering, and helping others at your own pace. Along the way, you\u2019ll face light platforming and puzzles that add just the right touch of challenge \u2013\u00a0fun, rewarding, and never too intense. It\u2019s a warm, curious adventure where cozy exploration and playful problem-solving go paw in paw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/9ff00f54fb385e7e3bbbd46475aa37d5.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a lively bunch of island characters: funny, sweet, wise, bubbly, and even a little grumpy. Some could use your help, while others may guide you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.poster.avif?t=1755353596\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.webm?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/942684b821b2f1a4c4134c8dc3dc6fd1.mp4?t=1755353596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get to know them, hear their stories, and build friendships, you\u2019ll take one step closer to restoring the island\u2019s natural balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861710/extras/be973a908acdcaa1c5a61b